### resonate — pipeline artifacts ###

# Tracked sources (in git, do NOT ignore):
#   plan.json           creative plan
#   song.md             lyrics + style
#   score.abc           ABC notation
#   score.meta.json     YuE2 generation info (seed, request, timing)
#   score.mid           clean abcjs MIDI
#   score.human.mid     humanized MIDI (what gets rendered to WAV)
#   thumbnail.*         cover art for the video (yours — supplied by hand)

